OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA warm and
OL,6,Fmostly dry evening, but a few showers
OL,7,Fare possible and staying similar
OL,8,Fovernight with clear spells. A much
OL,9,Fwarmer and more humid night compared
OL,10,Fto last night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FCloudier and more humid than
OL,13,Fon Monday with a chance of showers,
OL,14,Fthese locally heavy and thundery but
OL,15,Fmany places remaining dry. Sunny
OL,16,Fspells developing and feeling very
OL,17,Fwarm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
