OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FCooler
OL,6,Fand breezier on Wednesday with a few
OL,7,Fshowers possible. Feeling notably
OL,8,Ffresher thereafter with a mixture of
OL,9,Fcloud, warm sunny spells and the
OL,10,Fchance of the odd shower.
